{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Lawin Catch The Kim</i> is a relaxing and easy-to-pick-up casual game. In the game, players need to herd cute little chickens back to their nests to earn points. Once the target score is reached, you can move on to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features rich levels, each with unique challenges that provide a continuous sense of progression. The smooth difficulty curve offers players an increasing challenge as they delve deeper into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional box-pushing games, <i>Lawin Catch The Kim</i> incorporates the unique traits of the chickens and the layout of the nests, requiring players to design a clever action sequence within a limited time. It\u2019s all about finding the right angles and routes to complete the task under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its adorable art style and charming NPCs (or, as I like to call them, &quot;friends&quot;), the game brings a delightful experience as you solve puzzles and enjoy the cute characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently, there are 15 levels, each with its own tough challenge. As you progress, the difficulty increases, and new levels and animal friends will be added in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to take on all the challenges and unlock your achievements?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520860?t=1740754043","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740754043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520860/1b23e54c44c8ec61fac59ec300e110f782e738cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740754043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520860/1b23e54c44c8ec61fac59ec300e110f782e738cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740754043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":